---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
        <link rel="stylesheet" type='text/css' href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/devicon.min.css" />
		<title>Astro</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<header>
			<div class="nav header">
				<p><a href="#index" id="logo">Vinicius Elias</a></p>
				<nav aria-label="Navegação principal" class="main-nav">
					<a href="#index">Sobre mim</a>
					<a href="#projetos">Projetos</a>
					<a href="#contato">Contato</a>
				</nav>
				<p></p>
			</div>
		</header>
		<div class="content">
			<h1 class="title">Olá, eu sou Vinicius Elias</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Desenvolvedor Fullstack</p>
			<div class="buttons">
				<a href="#projetos">Ver Projetos</a>
				<a href="#contato">Vamos Conversar</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<section id="contato" class="intro">
			<div class="intro-container">
				<div class="intro-text">
					<h1 class="title">Quem sou eu</h1>
					<p class="intro-p">
						Meu nome é Vinicius Elias, estudante de programação, atualmente cursando o 
						6º semestre de Análise e Desenvolvimento de Sistemas na Fatec de São José dos Campos.
						Fiz Ensino Médio Técnico em Informática no Colégio Joseense, e me interesso principalmente
						por desenvolvimento backend e análise e dados!
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="intro-photo">
					<img src="/foto.jpeg" alt="Foto Vinicius">
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="tech">
			<div class="tech-container">
				<h1 class="title">Tecnologias</h1>
				<div class="stack">
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>Linguagens de programação</p>
						<div class="stack-icons">
							<i class="devicon-python-plain colored" title="Python"></i>
							<i class="devicon-java-plain colored" title="Java"></i>
							<i class="devicon-javascript-plain colored" title="JavaScript"></i>
							<i class="devicon-typescript-plain colored" title="TypeScript"></i>
						</div>
					</div>					
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>Backend</p>
						<div class="stack-icons">
							<i class="devicon-nodejs-plain colored" title="Node.js"></i>
							<i class="devicon-nestjs-plain colored" title="NestJS"></i>
							<i class="devicon-fastapi-plain colored" title="FastAPI"></i>
							<i class="devicon-flask-plain colored" title="Flask"></i>
						</div>
					</div>					
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>Frontend</p>
						<div class="stack-icons">
							<i class="devicon-react-plain colored" title="React"></i>
							<i class="devicon-astro-plain colored" title="Astro"></i>
							<i class="devicon-bootstrap-plain colored" title="Bootstrap"></i>
							<i class="devicon-tailwindcss-plain colored" title="TailwindCSS"></i>
						</div>
					</div>					
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>Banco de dados</p>
						<div class="stack-icons">
							<i class="devicon-mysql-plain colored" title="MySQL"></i>
							<i class="devicon-postgresql-plain colored" title="PostgreSQL"></i>
							<i class="devicon-mongodb-plain colored" title="MongoDB"></i>
						</div>
					</div>					
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>DevOps e ferramentas</p>
						<div class="stack-icons">
							<i class="devicon-git-plain colored" title="Git"></i>
							<i class="devicon-github-plain colored" title="Github"></i>
							<i class="devicon-docker-plain colored"  title="Docker"></i>
							<i class="devicon-amazonwebservices-plain colored" title="AWS"></i>
						</div>
					</div>					
					<div class="stack-div">
						<p>Outros</p>
						<div class="stack-text">
							<p>Pacote Office</p>
							<p>Power BI</p>
							<p>Inglês avançado</p>
							<p>Ollama</p>
							<p>SCRUM</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<footer>
			<div class="nav footer">
				<div class="footer-content" id="contato">
					<p>Vamos construir algo juntos?</p>
					<p class="copyright">&copy; 2026 Vinicius Elias</p>
					<nav aria-label="Links de contato" class="contact-links">
						<a
							href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/viniciuseliasdev/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
						>
						<a
							href="https://github.com/ViniElias"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a
						>
					</nav>
				</div>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
